%%{init: {'theme':'neutral', 'flowchart':{'curve':'linear'}}}%%
flowchart LR
    P([Participant]) -->|ECG, EDA| PLUX[PLUX biosignalsplux hub]
    PLUX -->|Bluetooth| OS[OpenSignals]
    OS -->|LSL: physical units, 200 Hz| BF[Biofeedback Engine<br/>Python 3.10]

    BF -->|UDP 5005: text commands| U[Unity VR Scene]
    U -->|UDP 5006: JSON telemetry, 10 Hz| BF

    BF -->|LSL: state + telemetry| DASH[Operator Dashboard<br/>PyQt5]
    BF -->|CSV, JSON files| DISK[(Session Record)]

    U -->|render| HMD[Meta Quest HMD]
    HMD --- P

    classDef participant fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    classDef hardware   fill:#e8f4f8,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    classDef software   fill:#e8f8ea,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    classDef engine     fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    classDef storage    fill:#f8f0e8,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px

    class P,HMD participant
    class PLUX hardware
    class OS,U,DASH software
    class BF engine
    class DISK storage
